abstract: >-
  Code, fixed data splits, per-split results, statistics and manuscript figures for
  RAREGuard, a score-level fusion of isolation forest, one-class SVM and autoencoder
  detectors with a percentile threshold computed from unlabelled validation scores.
  The study evaluates fusion rules and weights, label-free threshold estimators, the
  assumed contamination rate, fraud in the legitimate training reference, and transfer
  from the ULB credit card dataset to PaySim.
